{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:00 2026-11-03 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"蘇家愛駒Chandler在澳洲贏馬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/37574a4d1b81677d5cab1164915ece67/2026-11/5407a286-2eef-406e-adf9-c9e9d7d9e0bb.jpg\"/>\n<p>「波」系馬主蘇振雄與其子蘇志康熱愛賽馬，在世界各地如香港、澳洲、日本、歐洲等地均有養馬。昨日蘇家前往澳洲Ballarat馬場，他們愛駒Chandler贏馬，蘇家開心拉頭馬。蘇振雄太太Mandy賽後立即與小記分享頭馬相，Chandler是由佩恩訓練，佩恩過往曾來港策騎，曾擔任做過方嘉柏主帥，現為練馬師，蘇太Mandy說：「我們除了一家人見證Chandler贏馬外，也很高興與佩恩、柏寶的兒子Tom一起晚餐，相聚暢談，十分盡興。」</p>\n<p>蘇家在澳洲剛贏馬，或可帶旺明晚他們跑第七場的團體馬「將睿」，由澳洲贏到香港。</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/190b8171b95dd50caeab78e960982388/2026-11/2a3486a0-3424-4788-8b18-081e3c1201cd.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4929846bd4ba204833d3507c44db262e/2026-11/3ea9176f-5dc3-49bd-8b13-7923343b0d96.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7bad57dd0e0e40988ed3e190ea74963d/2026-11/6abf2d7e-7b11-40c8-b0b9-2c67cabebbac.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f92affbb644bca93831a2f689cdffa78/2026-11/8c30c7e1-0c4c-426a-be8a-7e0848814b22.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b7c689adf5237206fadfc8e5b315bc33/2026-11/83e9e49a-bc98-4196-a64e-392ccfbb52e9.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/21f4cd92646b11175daabc2d5fad0717/2026-11/6502f9bb-734d-4594-8a75-86ace2f280f0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/764fefdeec2d3c30846abcb95db6a465/2026-11/7122e81a-0fc7-4027-9edc-666f06a3b8b0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/65c013487c58cbcdd7a567a4d30ecf0c/2026-11/2567854b-3a83-47c9-8d0f-5a110f077d70.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0b48d74ae624a771e60bd89f8b3630dd/2026-11/c039671f-bb04-4d98-ab8a-cbe66b80c935.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1716c780d848031b18b16deb77d601e2/2026-11/aa.jpg\"/>\n<p>陳嘉甜</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:43:24.061347+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":293,"images":11,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:00:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:19:11.661421+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:39:15.635137+00:00","content_hash":"7322c39a35f96eafc740e8ca232299f028f4fe7125ec12b95a5a3079b53173dd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}